OL,3,AUS and China must act as responsible
OL,4,Aglobal powers together, Xi says at
OL,5,AWhite House dinner
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump and First Lady Melania
OL,8,Fhave welcomed Xi Jinping and his wife
OL,9,FPeng Liyuan to the White House for a
OL,10,Fstate dinner - our reporter takes you
OL,11,Fthrough it
OL,13,FIn a speech at the dinner, Xi called
OL,14,Ffor a "new approach" for China and the
OL,15,FUS to act as responsible global powers
OL,16,Fin a changing world
OL,18,FMeanwhile, Trump gifted Xi a statue of
OL,19,Fa bald eagle and said the pair have
OL,20,F"never gotten along better" - other key
OL,21,Fmoments
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
